 wait:{l:'riki',r:'friend2',setup:[['B','I’m on the swing right now.','happy']],bad:[['A','Get off! I want it NOW!','upset'],['B','That’s not nice.','sad','That was rude. I don’t want to share with her.']],good:[['A','Can I have a turn after you?','happy'],['B','Sure! I’ll count to 20.','happy'],['A','I can wait. One, two, three…','think'],['B','Your turn! Here you go!','excited','Riki is patient. She’s fun to play with!']],q:'Which way got Riki a turn on the swing?'},
