 talk:{l:'riki',r:'friend2',setup:[['B','I went to the beach this weekend!','excited']],bad:[['A','Whatever. I got a new game.','neutral'],['B','Oh… okay.','sad','She doesn’t care about my story.']],good:[['A','Cool! What did you do there?','happy'],['B','I built a huge sandcastle!','excited'],['A','Wow! I love sandcastles too!','excited','Riki is a great listener!']],q:'Which way made Noa feel listened to?'},
